---
import BrandMark from '../ui/BrandMark.astro';
const check = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>';
const rows = ['Bodega Ejemplo S.A.C.', 'Bodega Ejemplo S.A.C.', 'Bodega Ejemplo S.A.C.'];
---
<section class="section dp" id="plataformas" aria-labelledby="medio-dp-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Dos plataformas</span>
      <h2 class="h-section" id="medio-dp-title">Dos plataformas, un solo <span class="pill pill-purple">cuadre</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Cada actor ve lo suyo, en línea, y los datos coinciden.</p>
      <p class="lead body">El distribuidor cobra y consulta desde su app. El supervisor revisa y valida desde su plataforma web. Ambos miran la misma verdad, en línea, porque cada pago se registra una sola vez y viaja a los dos lados.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="diagram" data-inview>
      <article class="plat a reveal">
        <span class="tag"><i></i>En ruta</span>
        <h3>App del distribuidor</h3>
        <div class="mock-wrap">
          <div class="mphone" role="img" aria-label="Simulación de la app del distribuidor">
            <div class="mp-top"><BrandMark brand="banbif" variant="blanco" size={12} /></div>
            <div class="mp-body">
            <div class="mp-h">Mis cobros del día</div>
            {rows.map((r, i) => (
              <div class="mp-row"><div><b>{r}</b><small>S/ •••.••</small></div><em class={i === 2 ? 'wait' : ''}>{i === 2 ? 'Esperando' : 'Conciliado'}</em></div>
            ))}
            <div class="mp-btn">Cerrar ruta</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="txt">Cobra con QR, valida al cliente por su RUC y consulta sus cobros del día desde el celular.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span set:html={check} />Validación de cliente en línea</li>
          <li><span set:html={check} />QR de cobro en segundos</li>
          <li><span set:html={check} />Consulta de lo cobrado</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div class="conn c1" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="h" viewBox="0 0 100 24" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path pathLength="100" d="M0 12H100" /></svg>
        <svg class="v" viewBox="0 0 24 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path pathLength="100" d="M12 0V100" /></svg>
        <span class="dot d1"></span><span class="dot d2"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="node reveal" style="--d:.15s">
        <div class="ring r1" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="ring r2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="core">
          <BrandMark brand="gloria" size={22} />
          <strong>ERP de Gloria</strong>
          <span>Registro único</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="conn c2" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="h" viewBox="0 0 100 24" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path pathLength="100" d="M0 12H100" /></svg>
        <svg class="v" viewBox="0 0 24 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path pathLength="100" d="M12 0V100" /></svg>
        <span class="dot d1"></span><span class="dot d2"></span>
      </div>

      <article class="plat b reveal" style="--d:.1s">
        <span class="tag"><i></i>En oficina</span>
        <h3>Plataforma web del supervisor</h3>
        <div class="mock-wrap">
          <div class="mbrowser" role="img" aria-label="Simulación de la plataforma web del supervisor">
            <div class="mb-bar"><BrandMark brand="banbif" variant="blanco" size={13} /><div class="url">supervisor · cobros</div></div>
            <div class="mb-body">
              <div class="mb-th"><span>Cliente</span><span>Monto</span><span>Estado</span></div>
              {rows.map((r, i) => (
                <div class="mb-tr"><span>{r}</span><span>S/ •••.••</span><em class={i === 2 ? 'wait' : ''}>{i === 2 ? 'Esperando' : 'Conciliado'}</em></div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="txt">Consulta los cobros de cada distribuidor y los contrasta con lo registrado, sin hojas de cálculo en el medio.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span set:html={check} />Consulta en línea por distribuidor</li>
          <li><span set:html={check} />Visibilidad de cada pago</li>
          <li><span set:html={check} />Cuadre al cierre de ruta</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="quote reveal">Al terminar la ruta, distribuidor y supervisor cuadran sus cobros. <span class="grad-text">Y todo coincide.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dp { overflow-x: clip; }
  .lead.body { font-size: 16px; }
  .diagram { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: center; gap: 0; max-width: 1100px; margin-inline: auto; }
  /* Contenedores regulares: App en cyan claro, Web en blanco, texto negro (pág. 22) */
  .plat { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius); padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px); color: var(--bb-black); }
  .plat.a { background: var(--bb-cyan-light); }
  .plat.b { background: var(--bb-white); }
  .tag { align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--bb-white); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bb-black); }
  .tag i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bb-green); }
  h3 { font-size: 22px; position: relative; }
  .txt { color: rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.78); font-size: 15px; }
  ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  li { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  li span { color: var(--bb-purple); display: grid; flex: none; }
  .mock-wrap { display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 190px; padding: 10px 0 0; position: relative; }

  /* Mock celular: barra cyan con logo BanBif */
  .mphone { width: 196px; border-radius: 26px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 14px; background: var(--bb-white); color: var(--bb-black); border: 5px solid var(--bb-black); box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -18px rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.55); position: relative; font-size: 11px; }
  .mp-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 34px; background: var(--bb-cyan); }
  .mp-body { padding: 0 12px; }
  .mp-h { font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
  .mp-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.12); }
  .mp-row b { display: block; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .mp-row small { color: rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.6); font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .mp-row em, .mb-tr em { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bb-black); background: var(--bb-gray); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .mp-row em::before, .mb-tr em::before { content: ''; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bb-green); }
  .mp-row em.wait, .mb-tr em.wait { background: var(--bb-purple-light); }
  .mp-row em.wait::before, .mb-tr em.wait::before { background: var(--bb-purple); }
  .mp-btn { margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--bb-purple); border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 0; }

  /* Mock navegador: encabezado tipo header BanBif */
  .mbrowser { width: 100%; max-width: 330px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bb-white); color: var(--bb-black); border: 1.5px solid rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.14); box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -20px rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.4); font-size: 11px; }
  .mb-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; background: var(--bb-cyan); }
  .url { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 10px; color: var(--bb-black); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .mb-body { padding: 6px 12px 12px; }
  .mb-th, .mb-tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr .9fr .9fr; gap: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 6px 0; }
  .mb-th { font-weight: 700; color: rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.6); font-size: 10px; }
  .mb-tr { border-top: 1px solid rgba(20, 25, 37, 0.12); }
  .mb-tr span:first-child { font-weight: 700; font-size: 10px; }
  .mb-tr span:nth-child(2) { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; }
  .mb-tr em { justify-self: start; }

  /* Conectores: líneas cyan, puntos que viajan en verde BanBif */
  .conn { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 24px; height: 84px; }
  .conn svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
  .conn .h { display: none; }
  .conn path { fill: none; stroke: var(--bb-cyan); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-dasharray: 100; stroke-dashoffset: 100; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.3s var(--ease) .3s; }
  .diagram.in-view .conn path { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  .dot { position: absolute; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bb-green); box-shadow: 0 0 8px 1px rgba(196, 214, 0, 0.55); opacity: 0; left: 50%; margin-left: -4px; top: 0; }
  .diagram.in-view .dot { animation: dosplataformas-up 2.4s ease-in-out 1.6s infinite; }
  .diagram.in-view .dot.d2 { animation-delay: 2.8s; }
  .c1 .dot { animation-name: dosplataformas-up !important; }
  .c2 .dot { animation-name: dosplataformas-down !important; }
  @keyframes dosplataformas-up { 0% { transform: translateY(80px); opacity: 0; } 15%, 85% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateY(-4px); opacity: 0; } }
  @keyframes dosplataformas-down { 0% { transform: translateY(-4px); opacity: 0; } 15%, 85% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateY(80px); opacity: 0; } }

  /* Nodo central: contenedor con logo Gloria */
  .node { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 210px; height: 210px; z-index: 1; }
  .core { position: relative; width: 158px; min-height: 140px; border-radius: 42% / 48%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; text-align: center; padding: 14px 10px; background: var(--surface-2); border: 2px solid var(--bb-cyan); }
  .core strong { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--bb-white); }
  .core span { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--bb-cyan); }
  .ring { position: absolute; inset: 24px; border-radius: 42% / 48%; border: 1.5px solid rgba(32, 166, 255, 0.55); animation: dosplataformas-ring 3.2s ease-out infinite; }
  .r2 { animation-delay: 1.6s; }
  @keyframes dosplataformas-ring { from { transform: scale(.85); opacity: .8; } to { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0; } }

  .quote { text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 34px); line-height: 1.25; max-width: 24ch; margin: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) auto 0; }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .diagram { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 84px 210px 84px minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: center; }
    .plat { align-self: stretch; }
    .conn { width: 100%; height: 24px; }
    .conn .h { display: block; } .conn .v { display: none; }
    .dot { left: 0; top: 50%; margin: -4px 0 0 0; }
    .c1 .dot { animation-name: dosplataformas-left !important; }
    .c2 .dot { animation-name: dosplataformas-right !important; }
  }
  @keyframes dosplataformas-left { 0% { transform: translateX(80px); opacity: 0; } 15%, 85% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateX(-4px); opacity: 0; } }
  @keyframes dosplataformas-right { 0% { transform: translateX(-4px); opacity: 0; } 15%, 85% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateX(80px); opacity: 0; } }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .conn path { stroke-dashoffset: 0; transition: none; }
    .dot, .ring { animation: none !important; }
    .dot { opacity: 1; }
  }
</style>
